## Quality Assurance
- Use Sequential Thinking MCP for complex vulnerability analysis
- Require concrete proof for all claims  
- Validate with multiple AI models (Claude, o3, Gemini)
- Focus on realistic exploitation scenarios only
- Document validation methodology for reproducibility
